        {
          "id": "3caa993e-3170-3eea-b87a-37cb5898dc4a",
          "content": {
            "id": "3caa993e-3170-3eea-b87a-37cb5898dc4a",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Nuclear energy: US needs to catch up to Asia's 'Manhattan Project'",
            "description": "<p>Trump Media & Technology Group (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DJT\">DJT</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DJTWW\">DJTWW</a>) \u2014 the parent company of social media platform Truth Social \u2014 announced its plans to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/trump-media-stock-surges-more-than-30-on-surprise-merger-with-power-firm-tae-153158724.html\">merge with nuclear energy startup TAE Technologies</a> in a deal that could be valued up to $6 billion. TAE seeks to begin construction of its fusion power plant in 2026.</p>\n<p>Futurum CEO Daniel Newman to expand upon how he sees the regulatory environment unfolding for nuclear fusion projects as the energy demands to power AI data centers increase.</p>\n<p>Also catch Daniel Newman weigh in on TAE's<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/taes-nuclear-fusion-plant-timeline-210900639.html\"> \"very, very ambitious\" construction timeline</a> for its fusion power project.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Trump Media & Technology Group (DJT, DJTWW) \u2014 the parent company of social media platform Truth Social \u2014 announced its plans to merge with nuclear energy startup TAE Technologies in a deal that could be valued up to $6 billion. TAE seeks to begin construction of its fusion power plant in 2026. Futurum CEO Daniel Newman to expand upon how he sees the regulatory environment unfolding for nuclear fusion projects as the energy demands to power AI data centers increase. Also catch Daniel Newman weigh in on TAE's \"very, very ambitious\" construction timeline for its fusion power project. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
